  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 810.09 Certificate of No Further Action",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 810.09 Certificate of No Further Action. Upon meeting the criteria for issuing a certificate of no further action specified in Env-Or 609.02, the department shall issue to the program participant a certificate of no further action as described in RSA 147-F:13, V.\n\nSource. #8809, eff 1-26-07; ss by #10833, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14421, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
